# Site-specific What's new notes live BESIDE THE DATABASE, which on a
# dev machine is this directory. They are deliberately outside version
# control: a deployment must not be able to overwrite a site's own notes.
site_notes.json
site_notes.json.tmp
# Performance logs (--perf-log), including the rolled-over predecessor
# and any before/after copies set aside while comparing drops.
*-perf.log
*-perf.log.1
*-perf-before.log
# Local acceptance-testing scratch: a copy of the dev database served on
# 8000 (validate.db is covered by *.db above) and its server output.
validate-server.log
validate-server.err
validate-server-before.log
# Session scratch: database copies, DOM-shim harnesses, perf notes.
.scratch/
